{
  "video_id": "QPW4mAjxBHM",
  "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QPW4mAjxBHM",
  "title": "Why You Must Look Like a Loser to Escape the Rat Race",
  "channel": "Hidden Yield",
  "total_snippets": 249,
  "duration_seconds": 545.76,
  "transcript": [
    {
      "text": "It is a Friday night. You are 28 at a",
      "start": 0.0,
      "duration": 5.12,
      "end": 5.12
    },
    {
      "text": "long wooden table in a restaurant that's",
      "start": 3.12,
      "duration": 4.52,
      "end": 7.64
    },
    {
      "text": "slightly too loud with lighting slightly",
      "start": 5.12,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "end": 8.88
    },
    {
      "text": "too dim.",
      "start": 7.64,
      "duration": 3.56,
      "end": 11.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Six of you, friends from college, still",
      "start": 8.88,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "end": 13.56
    },
    {
      "text": "meeting up like nothing's changed.",
      "start": 11.2,
      "duration": 4.24,
      "end": 15.44
    },
    {
      "text": "The bill lands in a black leather folio",
      "start": 13.56,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "end": 17.2
    },
    {
      "text": "with a soft slap.",
      "start": 15.44,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "end": 19.52
    },
    {
      "text": "$480",
      "start": 17.2,
      "duration": 4.24,
      "end": 21.44
    },
    {
      "text": "You ordered the chicken and drank tap",
      "start": 19.52,
      "duration": 4.88,
      "end": 24.4
    },
    {
      "text": "water. Your share is 35.",
      "start": 21.44,
      "duration": 5.2,
      "end": 26.64
    },
    {
      "text": "But Marcus, across from you, gets there",
      "start": 24.4,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "end": 28.56
    },
    {
      "text": "first and drops a heavy metal credit",
      "start": 26.64,
      "duration": 3.4,
      "end": 30.04
    },
    {
      "text": "card on the leather.",
      "start": 28.56,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "end": 32.4
    },
    {
      "text": "It makes a distinct thud, the kind of",
      "start": 30.04,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "end": 34.52
    },
    {
      "text": "sound that's engineered.",
      "start": 32.4,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "end": 36.56
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Let's just split it six ways,\" he says,",
      "start": 34.52,
      "duration": 4.96,
      "end": 39.48
    },
    {
      "text": "waving down the waiter. \"Keep it easy.\"",
      "start": 36.56,
      "duration": 5.08,
      "end": 41.64
    },
    {
      "text": "That's $80 a person.",
      "start": 39.48,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "end": 43.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Five years ago, you'd have nodded along",
      "start": 41.64,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "end": 46.04
    },
    {
      "text": "and handed over your card just to avoid",
      "start": 43.68,
      "duration": 5.04,
      "end": 48.72
    },
    {
      "text": "being the guy who does math out loud.",
      "start": 46.04,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "end": 50.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Tonight, you don't.",
      "start": 48.72,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "end": 53.28
    },
    {
      "text": "You set three $20 bills on the table and",
      "start": 50.76,
      "duration": 5.32,
      "end": 56.08
    },
    {
      "text": "say, \"I'm just going to cover mine.\"",
      "start": 53.28,
      "duration": 5.12,
      "end": 58.4
    },
    {
      "text": "The table goes quiet for a second.",
      "start": 56.08,
      "duration": 4.8,
      "end": 60.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Marcus glances at your plain T-shirt.",
      "start": 58.4,
      "duration": 4.6,
      "end": 63.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Sarah looks down at her lap.",
      "start": 60.88,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "end": 65.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Pity crosses both their faces at almost",
      "start": 63.0,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "end": 67.12
    },
    {
      "text": "the same moment, like they'd rehearsed",
      "start": 65.24,
      "duration": 2.8,
      "end": 68.04
    },
    {
      "text": "it.",
      "start": 67.12,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "end": 70.12
    },
    {
      "text": "They think you're falling behind. They",
      "start": 68.04,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "end": 71.88
    },
    {
      "text": "think you're losing.",
      "start": 70.12,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "end": 74.2
    },
    {
      "text": "You let them think it. Because two years",
      "start": 71.88,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "end": 76.44
    },
    {
      "text": "ago, an old man named Whitfield taught",
      "start": 74.2,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "end": 78.04
    },
    {
      "text": "you something that had nothing to do",
      "start": 76.44,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "end": 80.28
    },
    {
      "text": "with a stock tip. It had to do with a",
      "start": 78.04,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "end": 81.68
    },
    {
      "text": "truck.",
      "start": 80.28,
      "duration": 3.48,
      "end": 83.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Whitfield lived two doors down and drove",
      "start": 81.68,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "end": 86.16
    },
    {
      "text": "a Ford so old the paint had faded from",
      "start": 83.76,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "end": 88.44
    },
    {
      "text": "red to a sunburnt pink.",
      "start": 86.16,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "end": 90.2
    },
    {
      "text": "He helped you move a couch one Saturday",
      "start": 88.44,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "end": 92.12
    },
    {
      "text": "without being asked twice, and you",
      "start": 90.2,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "end": 93.96
    },
    {
      "text": "figured he was scraping by on a tight",
      "start": 92.12,
      "duration": 3.08,
      "end": 95.2
    },
    {
      "text": "pension.",
      "start": 93.96,
      "duration": 3.48,
      "end": 97.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Then his daughter mentioned in passing",
      "start": 95.2,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "end": 99.04
    },
    {
      "text": "that her father owned four rental",
      "start": 97.44,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "end": 101.48
    },
    {
      "text": "properties free and clear. He just liked",
      "start": 99.04,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "end": 102.88
    },
    {
      "text": "the truck.",
      "start": 101.48,
      "duration": 3.2,
      "end": 104.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Something shifted in your chest on that",
      "start": 102.88,
      "duration": 5.48,
      "end": 108.36
    },
    {
      "text": "porch. Not envy, recognition.",
      "start": 104.68,
      "duration": 5.32,
      "end": 110.0
    },
    {
      "text": "You'd read that truck as evidence of",
      "start": 108.36,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "end": 112.16
    },
    {
      "text": "struggle your whole life. It was",
      "start": 110.0,
      "duration": 4.88,
      "end": 114.88
    },
    {
      "text": "evidence of the opposite. The man had",
      "start": 112.16,
      "duration": 5.2,
      "end": 117.36
    },
    {
      "text": "nothing left to prove, so he'd quietly",
      "start": 114.88,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "end": 119.88
    },
    {
      "text": "stop performing decades ago.",
      "start": 117.36,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "end": 121.36
    },
    {
      "text": "That was the day you started paying",
      "start": 119.88,
      "duration": 3.72,
      "end": 123.6
    },
    {
      "text": "attention to what money actually does",
      "start": 121.36,
      "duration": 5.4,
      "end": 126.76
    },
    {
      "text": "when nobody's forcing it to perform.",
      "start": 123.6,
      "duration": 5.8,
      "end": 129.4
    },
    {
      "text": "The theater of the middle class.",
      "start": 126.76,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "end": 130.92
    },
    {
      "text": "We're raised inside a culture that",
      "start": 129.4,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "end": 133.0
    },
    {
      "text": "treats money like a visual medium,",
      "start": 130.92,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "end": 135.04
    },
    {
      "text": "something meant to be seen, not just",
      "start": 133.0,
      "duration": 3.24,
      "end": 136.24
    },
    {
      "text": "held.",
      "start": 135.04,
      "duration": 2.84,
      "end": 137.88
    },
    {
      "text": "A better title is supposed to mean a",
      "start": 136.24,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "end": 140.4
    },
    {
      "text": "bigger zip code. A raise is supposed to",
      "start": 137.88,
      "duration": 5.16,
      "end": 143.04
    },
    {
      "text": "mean a heavier car payment. A bonus is",
      "start": 140.4,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "end": 144.88
    },
    {
      "text": "supposed to mean a watch that costs more",
      "start": 143.04,
      "duration": 4.8,
      "end": 147.84
    },
    {
      "text": "than the sedan parked three spaces down.",
      "start": 144.88,
      "duration": 4.88,
      "end": 149.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Walk through any office parking lot on a",
      "start": 147.84,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "end": 152.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Monday and you can watch it happening.",
      "start": 149.76,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "end": 154.76
    },
    {
      "text": "The guy two cubicles over leases a car",
      "start": 152.4,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "end": 157.16
    },
    {
      "text": "he can't afford because showing up in",
      "start": 154.76,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "end": 159.12
    },
    {
      "text": "anything older feels like showing up",
      "start": 157.16,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "end": 161.6
    },
    {
      "text": "underdressed for his own life.",
      "start": 159.12,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "end": 163.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Nobody told him to buy it. The culture",
      "start": 161.6,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "end": 166.24
    },
    {
      "text": "did the telling years ago through every",
      "start": 163.88,
      "duration": 4.6,
      "end": 168.48
    },
    {
      "text": "ad and every raised eyebrow at every",
      "start": 166.24,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "end": 169.92
    },
    {
      "text": "barbecue.",
      "start": 168.48,
      "duration": 2.96,
      "end": 171.44
    },
    {
      "text": "The people around you aren't really",
      "start": 169.92,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "end": 174.48
    },
    {
      "text": "buying things. They're buying permission",
      "start": 171.44,
      "duration": 4.96,
      "end": 176.4
    },
    {
      "text": "to be respected by a stranger at a red",
      "start": 174.48,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "end": 179.2
    },
    {
      "text": "light, to feel superior for 4 seconds at",
      "start": 176.4,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "end": 180.72
    },
    {
      "text": "a dinner party.",
      "start": 179.2,
      "duration": 3.32,
      "end": 182.52
    },
    {
      "text": "They're paying an invisible tax to",
      "start": 180.72,
      "duration": 3.36,
      "end": 184.08
    },
    {
      "text": "maintain the illusion they're winning a",
      "start": 182.52,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "end": 186.64
    },
    {
      "text": "game with no finish line.",
      "start": 184.08,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "end": 188.56
    },
    {
      "text": "You do the math instead and it says",
      "start": 186.64,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "end": 190.32
    },
    {
      "text": "something uncomfortable.",
      "start": 188.56,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "end": 192.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Looking wealthy is the exact mechanism",
      "start": 190.32,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "end": 194.32
    },
    {
      "text": "that keeps most people from ever",
      "start": 192.64,
      "duration": 3.52,
      "end": 196.16
    },
    {
      "text": "becoming wealthy.",
      "start": 194.32,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "end": 198.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Every dollar spent on the costume is a",
      "start": 196.16,
      "duration": 4.24,
      "end": 200.4
    },
    {
      "text": "dollar that can't compound quietly in",
      "start": 198.28,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "end": 201.88
    },
    {
      "text": "the background.",
      "start": 200.4,
      "duration": 3.36,
      "end": 203.76
    },
    {
      "text": "So, you make a decision nobody throws a",
      "start": 201.88,
      "duration": 3.32,
      "end": 205.2
    },
    {
      "text": "party for.",
      "start": 203.76,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "end": 207.96
    },
    {
      "text": "You step off the stage piece by piece",
      "start": 205.2,
      "duration": 6.04,
      "end": 211.24
    },
    {
      "text": "and don't tell anyone you're doing it.",
      "start": 207.96,
      "duration": 5.12,
      "end": 213.08
    },
    {
      "text": "The pity phase.",
      "start": 211.24,
      "duration": 3.88,
      "end": 215.12
    },
    {
      "text": "You don't announce your exit, you just",
      "start": 213.08,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "end": 217.28
    },
    {
      "text": "quietly stop performing.",
      "start": 215.12,
      "duration": 6.44,
      "end": 221.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Your car crosses 100,000 mi, then 150.",
      "start": 217.28,
      "duration": 6.12,
      "end": 223.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Paint chips off the hood in a shape that",
      "start": 221.56,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "end": 225.48
    },
    {
      "text": "looks a little like Florida.",
      "start": 223.4,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "end": 227.76
    },
    {
      "text": "You don't trade it in. You park it next",
      "start": 225.48,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "end": 230.24
    },
    {
      "text": "to your co-workers gleaming SUVs and",
      "start": 227.76,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "end": 232.76
    },
    {
      "text": "walk inside without a second thought.",
      "start": 230.24,
      "duration": 5.12,
      "end": 235.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Your phone screen cracks on a Tuesday.",
      "start": 232.76,
      "duration": 4.52,
      "end": 237.28
    },
    {
      "text": "You slap a protector over the spiderweb",
      "start": 235.36,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "end": 239.52
    },
    {
      "text": "underneath and keep using it for 2 more",
      "start": 237.28,
      "duration": 3.36,
      "end": 240.64
    },
    {
      "text": "years.",
      "start": 239.52,
      "duration": 2.88,
      "end": 242.4
    },
    {
      "text": "You stop showing up to dinners where the",
      "start": 240.64,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "end": 245.28
    },
    {
      "text": "food is just an excuse to be looked at.",
      "start": 242.4,
      "duration": 5.56,
      "end": 247.96
    },
    {
      "text": "At first, it costs you something real.",
      "start": 245.28,
      "duration": 4.28,
      "end": 249.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Pulling up to a red light in your",
      "start": 247.96,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "end": 251.4
    },
    {
      "text": "12-year-old sedan next to a new",
      "start": 249.56,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "end": 253.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Mercedes, some ancient part of your",
      "start": 251.4,
      "duration": 4.24,
      "end": 255.64
    },
    {
      "text": "brain screams that everyone can see",
      "start": 253.64,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "end": 258.64
    },
    {
      "text": "exactly how far behind you've fallen.",
      "start": 255.64,
      "duration": 5.52,
      "end": 261.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Then, around the 8-month mark, the pain",
      "start": 258.64,
      "duration": 5.04,
      "end": 263.68
    },
    {
      "text": "flips into something closer to power.",
      "start": 261.16,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "end": 265.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Almost nobody is actually watching you",
      "start": 263.68,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "end": 267.68
    },
    {
      "text": "to see if you're winning. They're",
      "start": 265.88,
      "duration": 3.4,
      "end": 269.28
    },
    {
      "text": "watching you to measure themselves",
      "start": 267.68,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "end": 270.68
    },
    {
      "text": "against you.",
      "start": 269.28,
      "duration": 3.32,
      "end": 272.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Step off their measuring stick and you",
      "start": 270.68,
      "duration": 3.4,
      "end": 274.08
    },
    {
      "text": "become invisible to the whole",
      "start": 272.6,
      "duration": 4.24,
      "end": 276.84
    },
    {
      "text": "competition, and invisibility turns out",
      "start": 274.08,
      "duration": 4.6,
      "end": 278.68
    },
    {
      "text": "to be one of the most comfortable places",
      "start": 276.84,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "end": 281.84
    },
    {
      "text": "in the world to quietly build something.",
      "start": 278.68,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "end": 283.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Your friends stop asking you for",
      "start": 281.84,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "end": 286.2
    },
    {
      "text": "financial advice. At Thanksgiving, your",
      "start": 283.4,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "end": 287.8
    },
    {
      "text": "aunt pulls you aside near the coat",
      "start": 286.2,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "end": 289.96
    },
    {
      "text": "closet, lowers her voice like she's",
      "start": 287.8,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "end": 292.48
    },
    {
      "text": "asking about a diagnosis, and offers to",
      "start": 289.96,
      "duration": 5.04,
      "end": 295.0
    },
    {
      "text": "help if you ever need it.",
      "start": 292.48,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "end": 296.56
    },
    {
      "text": "\"We're doing fine,\" you tell her",
      "start": 295.0,
      "duration": 5.08,
      "end": 300.08
    },
    {
      "text": "smiling. You don't mention the $280,000",
      "start": 296.56,
      "duration": 5.2,
      "end": 301.76
    },
    {
      "text": "in investments you crossed the previous",
      "start": 300.08,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "end": 304.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Tuesday, or that the dividends alone now",
      "start": 301.76,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "end": 306.48
    },
    {
      "text": "cover more than she makes in a 40-hour",
      "start": 304.48,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "end": 308.8
    },
    {
      "text": "week. You let her believe what she wants",
      "start": 306.48,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "end": 311.2
    },
    {
      "text": "to believe because pity, when you let",
      "start": 308.8,
      "duration": 4.88,
      "end": 313.68
    },
    {
      "text": "people keep it, is the best camouflage",
      "start": 311.2,
      "duration": 5.04,
      "end": 316.24
    },
    {
      "text": "money can't buy.",
      "start": 313.68,
      "duration": 5.56,
      "end": 319.24
    },
    {
      "text": "The shield of invisibility.",
      "start": 316.24,
      "duration": 5.44,
      "end": 321.68
    },
    {
      "text": "When you look rich, you become a target",
      "start": 319.24,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "end": 323.4
    },
    {
      "text": "for salesmen circling the second you",
      "start": 321.68,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "end": 325.44
    },
    {
      "text": "walk into a dealership, for every",
      "start": 323.4,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "end": 327.36
    },
    {
      "text": "relative with a business plan scratched",
      "start": 325.44,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "end": 329.36
    },
    {
      "text": "onto a napkin who suddenly remembers",
      "start": 327.36,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "end": 331.2
    },
    {
      "text": "your number exists.",
      "start": 329.36,
      "duration": 3.56,
      "end": 332.92
    },
    {
      "text": "But when you look broke, the money",
      "start": 331.2,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "end": 334.8
    },
    {
      "text": "quietly leaves the room.",
      "start": 332.92,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "end": 337.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Your coworker Dave organizes a bachelor",
      "start": 334.8,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "end": 339.12
    },
    {
      "text": "party in Cabo and doesn't even think to",
      "start": 337.04,
      "duration": 4.28,
      "end": 341.32
    },
    {
      "text": "invite you because in his mind, you're",
      "start": 339.12,
      "duration": 3.88,
      "end": 343.0
    },
    {
      "text": "still the guy driving the car with the",
      "start": 341.32,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "end": 344.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Florida-shaped paint chip.",
      "start": 343.0,
      "duration": 4.84,
      "end": 347.84
    },
    {
      "text": "You save $4,000 simply by existing",
      "start": 344.96,
      "duration": 5.56,
      "end": 350.52
    },
    {
      "text": "exactly as everyone assumes you do.",
      "start": 347.84,
      "duration": 4.6,
      "end": 352.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Your cousin corners you at a cookout",
      "start": 350.52,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "end": 354.32
    },
    {
      "text": "with a pitch for a food truck, then",
      "start": 352.44,
      "duration": 4.52,
      "end": 356.96
    },
    {
      "text": "stops mid-sentence. Actually, never",
      "start": 354.32,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "end": 358.68
    },
    {
      "text": "mind. You're probably tight right now",
      "start": 356.96,
      "duration": 5.04,
      "end": 362.0
    },
    {
      "text": "anyway. He walks away and you let him.",
      "start": 358.68,
      "duration": 5.44,
      "end": 364.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Looking broke becomes a shield nobody",
      "start": 362.0,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "end": 366.04
    },
    {
      "text": "can see you holding. While your",
      "start": 364.12,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "end": 368.04
    },
    {
      "text": "co-workers do mental math on interest",
      "start": 366.04,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "end": 370.04
    },
    {
      "text": "rates, trapped in leases they can't",
      "start": 368.04,
      "duration": 4.28,
      "end": 372.32
    },
    {
      "text": "afford to break, you sit with a cup of",
      "start": 370.04,
      "duration": 4.6,
      "end": 374.64
    },
    {
      "text": "instant coffee watching a number grow a",
      "start": 372.32,
      "duration": 4.52,
      "end": 376.84
    },
    {
      "text": "little larger every month completely",
      "start": 374.64,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "end": 379.28
    },
    {
      "text": "undisturbed. You're weaponizing their",
      "start": 376.84,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "end": 381.48
    },
    {
      "text": "judgment. They're trading their freedom",
      "start": 379.28,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "end": 383.68
    },
    {
      "text": "to buy a costume. You're trading the",
      "start": 381.48,
      "duration": 4.8,
      "end": 386.28
    },
    {
      "text": "costume to buy your freedom back. One",
      "start": 383.68,
      "duration": 5.6,
      "end": 389.28
    },
    {
      "text": "quiet Tuesday at a time.",
      "start": 386.28,
      "duration": 5.6,
      "end": 391.88
    },
    {
      "text": "The separation years pass. You're 35",
      "start": 389.28,
      "duration": 5.04,
      "end": 394.32
    },
    {
      "text": "now. A recession hits and the whole",
      "start": 391.88,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "end": 396.36
    },
    {
      "text": "production everyone financed on credit",
      "start": 394.32,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "end": 398.68
    },
    {
      "text": "for a decade gets its lights shut off at",
      "start": 396.36,
      "duration": 5.32,
      "end": 401.68
    },
    {
      "text": "once. Marcus loses his job in the second",
      "start": 398.68,
      "duration": 6.24,
      "end": 404.92
    },
    {
      "text": "wave of layoffs. The $50,000",
      "start": 401.68,
      "duration": 5.68,
      "end": 407.36
    },
    {
      "text": "SUV is suddenly an anchor. The card that",
      "start": 404.92,
      "duration": 4.52,
      "end": 409.44
    },
    {
      "text": "used to hit the table so confidently is",
      "start": 407.36,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "end": 412.08
    },
    {
      "text": "maxed out. The lifestyle he built to be",
      "start": 409.44,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "end": 414.2
    },
    {
      "text": "looked at has become a house he can no",
      "start": 412.08,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "end": 416.2
    },
    {
      "text": "longer afford to heat.",
      "start": 414.2,
      "duration": 4.24,
      "end": 418.44
    },
    {
      "text": "He calls you on a Tuesday, his voice",
      "start": 416.2,
      "duration": 5.12,
      "end": 421.32
    },
    {
      "text": "tight, moving too fast. \"Hey man, how",
      "start": 418.44,
      "duration": 5.08,
      "end": 423.52
    },
    {
      "text": "are you holding up?\" he asks, really",
      "start": 421.32,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "end": 425.64
    },
    {
      "text": "asking about himself, assuming that",
      "start": 423.52,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "end": 427.16
    },
    {
      "text": "because you always looked like you had",
      "start": 425.64,
      "duration": 4.8,
      "end": 430.44
    },
    {
      "text": "less, you must be close to ruined, too.",
      "start": 427.16,
      "duration": 5.72,
      "end": 432.88
    },
    {
      "text": "\"I'm good.\" you tell him quietly. \"No",
      "start": 430.44,
      "duration": 5.56,
      "end": 436.0
    },
    {
      "text": "debt. Nothing to hold up, really.\"",
      "start": 432.88,
      "duration": 5.44,
      "end": 438.32
    },
    {
      "text": "There's a long pause, long enough that",
      "start": 436.0,
      "duration": 4.96,
      "end": 440.96
    },
    {
      "text": "you almost check if the call dropped. In",
      "start": 438.32,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "end": 442.88
    },
    {
      "text": "that silence, you can feel him running",
      "start": 440.96,
      "duration": 4.6,
      "end": 445.56
    },
    {
      "text": "the last 7 years back through his head.",
      "start": 442.88,
      "duration": 4.88,
      "end": 447.76
    },
    {
      "text": "The cheap dinners you skipped correctly",
      "start": 445.56,
      "duration": 5.08,
      "end": 450.64
    },
    {
      "text": "every time. The old car he used to nod",
      "start": 447.76,
      "duration": 5.4,
      "end": 453.16
    },
    {
      "text": "at like a punchline. He wasn't watching",
      "start": 450.64,
      "duration": 4.84,
      "end": 455.48
    },
    {
      "text": "you fall behind. He was watching you lap",
      "start": 453.16,
      "duration": 6.36,
      "end": 459.52
    },
    {
      "text": "him in a lane he never noticed existed.",
      "start": 455.48,
      "duration": 5.76,
      "end": 461.24
    },
    {
      "text": "The outro.",
      "start": 459.52,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "end": 463.68
    },
    {
      "text": "True wealth doesn't announce itself.",
      "start": 461.24,
      "duration": 4.96,
      "end": 466.2
    },
    {
      "text": "It's waking up on an ordinary Wednesday,",
      "start": 463.68,
      "duration": 4.52,
      "end": 468.2
    },
    {
      "text": "staring at the ceiling a second longer",
      "start": 466.2,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "end": 470.64
    },
    {
      "text": "than necessary, and realizing you don't",
      "start": 468.2,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "end": 472.88
    },
    {
      "text": "owe a single hour of the day to anyone",
      "start": 470.64,
      "duration": 3.72,
      "end": 474.36
    },
    {
      "text": "but yourself.",
      "start": 472.88,
      "duration": 3.48,
      "end": 476.36
    },
    {
      "text": "A few months ago, you helped Whitfield's",
      "start": 474.36,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "end": 478.36
    },
    {
      "text": "daughter clear out his garage after he",
      "start": 476.36,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "end": 481.0
    },
    {
      "text": "passed quietly in the same house he'd",
      "start": 478.36,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "end": 483.12
    },
    {
      "text": "lived in for 40 years.",
      "start": 481.0,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "end": 485.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Under a tarp next to the old Ford, you",
      "start": 483.12,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "end": 487.76
    },
    {
      "text": "found the paperwork. Four properties",
      "start": 485.36,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "end": 490.0
    },
    {
      "text": "paid in full. A balance that made you",
      "start": 487.76,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "end": 492.24
    },
    {
      "text": "sit down on an overturned bucket before",
      "start": 490.0,
      "duration": 3.88,
      "end": 493.88
    },
    {
      "text": "you could keep working.",
      "start": 492.24,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "end": 495.88
    },
    {
      "text": "He'd never once mentioned any of it in",
      "start": 493.88,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "end": 497.68
    },
    {
      "text": "10 years of waving at you over the",
      "start": 495.88,
      "duration": 2.92,
      "end": 498.8
    },
    {
      "text": "fence.",
      "start": 497.68,
      "duration": 2.96,
      "end": 500.64
    },
    {
      "text": "You drove home that night and finally",
      "start": 498.8,
      "duration": 3.48,
      "end": 502.28
    },
    {
      "text": "understood what he'd been doing all",
      "start": 500.64,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "end": 504.56
    },
    {
      "text": "along, and what you'd quietly started",
      "start": 502.28,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "end": 506.4
    },
    {
      "text": "doing, too, without ever giving it a",
      "start": 504.56,
      "duration": 3.08,
      "end": 507.64
    },
    {
      "text": "name.",
      "start": 506.4,
      "duration": 3.32,
      "end": 509.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, when the new neighbor's kid watches",
      "start": 507.64,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "end": 511.64
    },
    {
      "text": "you mow your lawn in the same faded",
      "start": 509.72,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "end": 514.12
    },
    {
      "text": "shirt, in the same old car parked in the",
      "start": 511.64,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "end": 516.32
    },
    {
      "text": "driveway, you know exactly what they're",
      "start": 514.12,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "end": 518.68
    },
    {
      "text": "assuming, and you know exactly what that",
      "start": 516.32,
      "duration": 4.24,
      "end": 520.56
    },
    {
      "text": "assumption is worth.",
      "start": 518.68,
      "duration": 3.52,
      "end": 522.2
    },
    {
      "text": "So, the next time someone gives you that",
      "start": 520.56,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "end": 524.32
    },
    {
      "text": "small, practiced look of pity because",
      "start": 522.2,
      "duration": 4.28,
      "end": 526.48
    },
    {
      "text": "your coat is a few years old, or your",
      "start": 524.32,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "end": 528.24
    },
    {
      "text": "phone has a crack running corner to",
      "start": 526.48,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "end": 530.6
    },
    {
      "text": "corner, don't feel a thing close to",
      "start": 528.24,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "end": 531.68
    },
    {
      "text": "shame.",
      "start": 530.6,
      "duration": 3.16,
      "end": 533.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Let them think you're losing, because",
      "start": 531.68,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "end": 535.88
    },
    {
      "text": "nobody ever notices the moment you slip",
      "start": 533.76,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "end": 538.16
    },
    {
      "text": "out the back door. And by the time they",
      "start": 535.88,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "end": 540.04
    },
    {
      "text": "look up from the scoreboard and realize",
      "start": 538.16,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "end": 542.2
    },
    {
      "text": "you're gone, you'll already be too far",
      "start": 540.04,
      "duration": 5.72,
      "end": 545.76
    },
    {
      "text": "ahead to ask how you did it.",
      "start": 542.2,
      "duration": 3.56,
      "end": 545.76
    }
  ]
}